  "description": "ExpertPdf PDF Merge Library combines PDF documents (files, streams, byte arrays) and images into a single PDF document, with control over the page size and orientation of new pages, compression, document information, PDF/A and security.\n\nThis package contains the library for .NET Framework 2.0 to 4.8.1, .NET Core 2.0+ and .NET 5 to .NET 11 (through .NET Standard 2.0). It is the build for 64-bit (x64) applications; for x86 and AnyCPU applications use ExpertPdf.MergePdf.\n\nFeatures\n- Merge PDF files, streams and byte arrays, including password protected documents\n- Add images (BMP, GIF, JPEG, PNG, TIFF) as new pages, and empty pages\n- Page size, orientation and compression level of the merged document\n- Document information: title, subject, author, keywords\n- Save as PDF/A-1b, PDF/A-2b, PDF/A-3b, PDF/A-3u or PDF/X-1a\n- Security: user and owner passwords, permissions, RC4 and AES encryption up to 256 bit\n- Save to a file, a stream or a byte array; thread safe",
  "iconFile": "images\\icon.jpg",
  "id": "ExpertPdf.MergePdf.x64",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-20T11:16:58.197Z",
