  "published": "2026-11-20T10:57:50.66Z",
  "readmeFile": "docs\\README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 10.0: PDF/A-1b, PDF/A-2b, PDF/A-3b, PDF/A-3u and PDF/X-1a output (PdfDocumentOptions.PdfStandardSubset). AppendPDFBytes: merge documents from memory. Insert documents, page ranges, images and empty pages at any position; reorder the merged pages. Booklet output (BookletOptions) and one bookmark per merged document (BookmarkOptions). Version 10 is part of the ExpertPdf 22.0 release: it requires a version 10 license key.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Merge PDF documents and images into one PDF in any .NET application. 64-bit build.",
